    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/AllenInterval>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Temporal Interval";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Defines a temporal interval for determining the value of the benefit.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the body corporate, and any body corporate related to the body corporate, have obtained directly or indirectly and that is reasonably attributable to the conduct constituting the offence—";
