<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-2-ss-4-logic-ltl-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LTL>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Recurring Trace";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Defines a recurring trace for determining the annual turnover.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "5% of the annual turnover of the body corporate during the period (the turnover period) of 12 months ending at the end of the month in which the conduct constituting the offence occurred.";
